# 统一换行：源码/脚本入库一律 LF，Windows 批处理保留 CRLF
# 否则 Linux 上的 GitHub Actions 会因为 CRLF 让 ./gradlew 报 "no such file or directory"
* text=auto

*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.pro text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.apk binary
